 control over your promotion.🆕 More redesigned screens & new gameplay mechanics Several parts of the game have been rebuilt and expanded.😡 Wrestler mood animations Wrestlers can now visually react to their current mood and situa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T06:38:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031424","verified_at":"2026-10-22T11:16:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1847286114029836","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"announcement","title":"Help Unlock the Future of WBS26","summary":"Steam Next Fest is live, and we’re excited to share the WBS26 Community Roadmap.WBS26 is growing together with its community, and every wishlist helps us push the game further. Community Milestones✅ 1,500 Wishlists — 30+ Real Promotions at Launch More than 30 real wrestling promotions will be available when WBS26 launches on December 1, 2026.🔒 2,000 Wishlists — Wrestler Career Mode A planned post-launch mode focused on building the career of a single wrestler.🔒 3,000 Wishlists — Expanded 3D Segm","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T17:54:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029836","verified_at":"2026-10-21T18:59:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1846651706689657","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"announcement","title":"WBS26 is coming to Steam Next Fest — try the demo October 19–26!","summary":"Your promotion. Your roster. Your show.Wrestling Booker Simulator 26 is joining Steam Next Fest, October 19–26! Try the demo and step into the role of a wrestling booker: build match cards, manage your roster, and shape your own wrestling promotion.Ready to book your next main event?Play the demo during Steam Next Fest and add WBS26 to your wishlist!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:43:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689657","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1845383656397310","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"announcement","title":"The WBS26 Demo 7.10 is here: free on Steam! 🔥","summary":"Book a real promotion in the new WBS26 demo: plan the calendar, sign free agents, build stars in the academy and the look editor, then watch smarter AI wrestlers fight it out live in 3D. Seven real federations. Full game December 1, 2026. Every promotion starts with an empty ring. 🥊The WBS26 Demo 7.10 is here: free on Steam! 🔥🗓️ Plan your whole month in the new calendar📥 Every message in your inbox is a decision✍️ Sign real free agents before your rivals do🎓 Build your own stars in the academy🎨 ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T18:24:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397310","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1843481262690274","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"update","title":"WBS26 Demo — update 9.09.26","summary":"WBS26 Demo — update 9.09.26 Heads-up first: saves from the 7.09 demo will not open in this build. The state layout changed, and a half-applied load produces a career that misbehaves weeks later instead of failing honestly — so old files are refused at the door and the menu says so once. Sorry for the restart; better now, in a demo, than after a month of booking. Events now tell you what they are Every event arrived in the same speech bubble from the same assistant, so a public match result read ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T19:58:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690274","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1842846814454031","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"announcement","title":"🔥 THE NEW WBS26 DEMO IS OUT TODAY! 🔥","summary":"🔥 THE NEW WBS26 DEMO IS OUT TODAY! 🔥 A completely new version of the Wrestling Booker Simulator 26 demo is now available!What’s included:🎥 New 3D Match Broadcast System 🤼 One-on-one matches presented in 3D 🏢 Three new wrestling promotions 🌍 Interface available in 11 languages 🎵 More than 20 entrance themes 📋 Booking, roster and contract management 🏆 Championships and title management 💰 Finances and promotion development 🖥️ Optimization for PC and Steam DeckThis demo is your first look at the dir","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T20:52:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454031","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1842212951314656","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"update","title":"WBS26 Development Update — August 2026","summary":"WBS26 Development Update — August 2026August was one of the busiest months of development for WBS26 so far.A large part of the month was focused on expanding the world of the game. We continued working directly with independent wrestling promotions and wrestlers from different countries, securing permissions and collecting the assets needed to represent them properly in WBS26.By the end of August, the project had grown to around 30 officially represented wrestling promotions and approximately 50","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T20:36:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951314656","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1839041357028457","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"update","title":"🛠️ WBS26 — NEW DEMO UPDATE","summary":"The new patch is now available!🌞 Step-by-step tutorial added Learn the basics of WBS26 together with AMATERASU.🐛 Fixed several bugs reported by the community 🏆 Fixed the tournament system bug 🤼 Added new official free agents to the gameThank you to everyone who sends feedback and helps make WBS26 better!🎮 Try the updated demo and Wishlist WBS26 on Steam!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T04:11:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357028457","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1838407329264129","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"announcement","title":"🌊 TIDAL WRESTLING IS COMING TO WBS26! 🌊","summary":"We’re proud to officially announce our partnership with Tidal Wrestling! 🤝When Wrestling Booker Simulator 26 launches, players will be able to take control of Tidal Wrestling, manage its roster, book shows, build rivalries, develop champions, and lead the promotion into a new era.This partnership brings another real independent wrestling promotion into the WBS26 universe—and we’re only getting started. 🔥A huge thank you to the Tidal Wrestling team for believing in the project and joining us on t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-19T19:11:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329264129","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1838407329255195","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"announcement","title":"SLAM! Wrestling is officially coming to WBS26 — Wrestling Booker Simulator 26!","summary":"Build your roster, create unforgettable rivalries, book major events and lead your promotion to the top.A huge thank you to @slamwres for the trust and support — and a special personal thank you to @dianawrestling for her help, openness and support of the project! 💖Add WBS26 to your Steam Wishlist now. 🔥","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-15T21:46:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329255195","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1838407329255192","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"announcement","title":"🔥 Prime Time Wrestling is officially coming to WBS26!","summary":"We’re excited to announce that PTW – @prime_time_wrestlingpl will be featured in Wrestling Booker Simulator 26!A huge thank you to @panpawlowski for his trust, support, and the opportunity to bring PTW into the world of WBS26. We truly appreciate this partnership and can’t wait to show you what’s coming next.🎮 Wishlist WBS26 on Steam and stay tuned for more federation and wrestler reveals!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-15T21:44:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329255192","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1837955055364315","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"announcement","title":"UWA is now live in the WBS26 Demo!","summary":"Ukrainian Wrestling Arena is officially available in the game. Choose UWA, book your shows, and take Ukrainian wrestling to the next level.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T19:47:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055364315","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1836506165581698","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"announcement","title":"UWA officially joins WBS26!","summary":"UWA officially joins WBS26!We are proud to officially welcome UWA — Ukrainian Wrestling Arena to Wrestling Booker Simulator 26.UWA will be featured in the game as part of our growing lineup of real independent wrestling promotions.This is an important step for us. WBS26 is becoming more than just a booking simulator — it is becoming a place where indie wrestling gets more spotlight, more life, and more space for fans to discover it.Welcome to the game, UWA. This is only the beginning.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-08T21:12:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165581698","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1836506165579609","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"announcement","title":"300 wishlists on Steam.","summary":"300 wishlists on Steam.For a big studio, that might just be a number. For me, it means a lot.WBS26 started as a small indie idea, and seeing people actually add it to their wishlist, play the demo, send feedback, and follow the project honestly keeps me going.There’s still a lot to improve — UI, balance, new systems, federations, roster work, polish after the demo — but this is a really cool milestone.Thank you to everyone who supported the game so far.300 wishlists reached. Next stop — higher.W","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-08T06:05:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165579609","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1836506165576614","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes","summary":"Patch Notes — Demo Update (06/29 → 07/06)NewWatch Broadcast — after a match, watch it play out as an animated broadcast: fighter cards, momentum/crowd heat meters, live commentary, effects, and a winner panel — right alongside the usual text recap.Ticket Pricing screen — set your own price/attendance strategy separately for weekly shows, specials, tours, and PPVs.Weekly News overhaul — new War Room tab (your strategy & intel hub), plus a cleaner feed, cards, and event pages.Show Result screen re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T19:42:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165576614","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1836506165560880","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"update","title":"WBS26Demo - NEW UPDATE","summary":"WBS26Demo — Dev Build Patch NotesJune 29, 2026This update adds new management pressure, better weekly news variety, improved career-ending storylines, more detailed match results, calendar upgrades, and several UI/quality-of-life improvements.New FeaturesOwner / Board Mandate SystemRunning a promotion now comes with real expectations.If you take over an existing promotion, you will answer to the Board. They will give you quarterly goals, and your confidence rating will change depending on your r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-29T19:49:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165560880","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1836506165546833","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"announcement","title":"200+ Wishlists on Steam!","summary":"WBS26 — Wrestling Booker Simulator 26 has now reached 200+ wishlists on Steam.For a small indie project, this is a huge milestone. I’m truly grateful to everyone who added the game to their wishlist, shared it with friends, left a comment, or simply followed the development.I’m continuing to work hard on the game: improving the UI, booking systems, promotions, random events, contracts, roster management, and the overall gameplay loop.The goal is to create more than just a wrestling booking simul","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T18:18:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165546833","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4818620-1835871199316508","game_id":"steam-4818620","kind":"announcement","title":"WBS26 Demo is Now Available!","summary":"The WBS26 Wrestling Booker Simulator demo is now available on Steam!WBS26 is a wrestling booking management simulator where you do much more than just place matches on a card. You run an entire promotion: manage your roster, titles, contracts, wrestler morale, random events, fan reactions, backstage politics, and the overall direction of your company.In the demo, you can:• book your first shows;• test the match and segment booking system;• manage championship titles;• work with your roster and c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T19:01:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199316508","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4818620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:29:5